{"content_kind":"narrative.vn","definition":{"id":"ch1_cold_open","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"bgm":"res://assets/audio/bgm/dialogue_tense.mp3","chapter":1,"title":"Chapter 1, Before the Ash Settled","title_ko":"1장, 재가 가라앉기 전"},"steps":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_rim_omen.png","cg_motion":"pull_back","fade_ms":1800,"sfx":"void_pulse"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"narrate":"Before Arrel remembered the dead beast, he remembered the sky opening.","narrate_ko":"아렐은 죽은 괴물보다 먼저, 하늘이 열리던 순간을 기억했다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_void_beast_emergence.png","cg_motion":"push_in","fade_ms":350,"impact":"void","sfx":"battle_intro"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"narrate":"The Rim answered with teeth. A Void Beast descended through the ash, and the forest bent beneath it.","narrate_ko":"림은 이빨로 대답했다. 보이드 비스트가 재를 가르며 내려왔고, 숲 전체가 그 아래에서 휘었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"add_grains":4,"set_flag":"opening_named_self"},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/2/choice/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":0,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Begin with 4 Grains, proof that Arrel still knows what is his.","effect_ko":"그레인 4개 획득, 아직 자신의 것을 구분할 수 있다는 증거.","text":"Say your name before the dark can take it.","text_ko":"어둠이 빼앗기 전에 자신의 이름을 말한다."}},{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"add_item":"smoke_bomb","set_flag":"opening_guarded_light"},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/2/choice/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Gain 1 Smoke Bomb from Elia's field kit.","effect_ko":"엘리아의 야전 장비에서 연막탄 1개 획득.","text":"Step between the beast and Elia's lantern.","text_ko":"괴물과 엘리아의 등불 사이로 들어선다."}},{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"set_flag":"vb_read"},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/2/choice/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":2,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Carry its rhythm into the next Void Beast fight.","effect_ko":"놈의 리듬을 다음 보이드 비스트 전투까지 기억.","text":"Listen for the gap between its movements.","text_ko":"놈의 움직임 사이에 난 틈을 듣는다."}}],"choices_present":true,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"choice_hint":"Your opening instinct leaves a small advantage that survives into the next hunt.","choice_hint_ko":"첫 본능은 다음 사냥까지 남는 작은 우위가 됩니다.","choice_title":"WHAT MOVES BEFORE MEMORY?","choice_title_ko":"기억보다 먼저 움직이는 것은?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"opening_named_self"},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_first_burn_strike.png","cg_motion":"strike","fade_ms":280,"impact":"memory","sfx":"burn"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"narrate":"Arrel. He spoke it once, then drove the name through the blade like a nail holding the world together.","narrate_ko":"아렐. 그는 이름을 한 번 입에 올리고, 세계를 붙드는 못처럼 칼날에 박아 넣었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"opening_guarded_light"},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_first_burn_strike.png","cg_motion":"strike","fade_ms":280,"impact":"memory","sfx":"burn"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"narrate":"He stepped toward the lantern, not away from the beast. The blade ignited where fear should have been.","narrate_ko":"그는 괴물에게서 물러나는 대신 등불 앞으로 나섰다. 두려움이 있어야 할 자리에서 칼날이 타올랐다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"vb_read"},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_first_burn_strike.png","cg_motion":"strike","fade_ms":280,"impact":"memory","sfx":"burn"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"narrate":"Three limbs high. One low. In the silence between them, Arrel found the place where the monster ended.","narrate_ko":"팔다리 셋은 높게, 하나는 낮게. 그 사이의 침묵 속에서 아렐은 괴물이 끝나는 자리를 찾아냈다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_opening_aftermath.png","cg_motion":"still","fade_ms":850,"impact":"heavy","sfx":"hit"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"narrate":"The beast was dead.","narrate_ko":"괴물은 죽어 있었다."}},{"action":{"action":"goto_scene","id":"ch1_prologue","start_index":1},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_cold_open/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","source_hash":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{}}]},"dialect":"vn","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"847cbfa91c56e36ce45e668801d3269ccc0e42700635ff7dc7c746645dcb9f7d","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_cold_open.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"fbfd5484030d55b3a620540ee2bd76c3e7515864e2ef725d7c370bb81c3109ae"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
